-- ===== MIC UP GRASS 1.1 ======================================================
-- Client-side terrain grass on Mic Up's baseplates, for KL rOSAD. Only you see it.
-- Mic Up only (18+ and the normal game): anywhere else it refuses to load.
-- Controls: size %, height offset (0 = exactly level with the baseplate), blade length, colour, blades,
-- and "avoid builds": no grass under or around anything built on the plate.
-- The grass is terrain laid flush on top of the plates (workspace.Baseplate and workspace.map.extra_room.platform).
-- The plates are never hidden or moved; their colour follows the grass colour and is put back when the grass goes.
--
-- Linked mode: getgenv().KLOSAD exists -> uses rOSAD's theme, accent, opacity and
-- scale live through its "look" port and closes with it ("unload" port).
-- rOSAD owns the ;grass command and calls getgenv().KLGrass.cmd(args).
-- ============================================================================

